\item \code{"log"}: \code{I = 1 - log(N + 1) / log(Nmax + 1)}; relative to the most
recorded cell, separating "few" from "enough" records.
\item \code{"linear"}: \code{I = 1 - N / Nmax}; only for effort without a long tail.
}

